zapret2control (0.5.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Complete the Qt 6 / KDE Kirigami production GUI migration.
  * Add centralized settings, theme and language selection, and adaptive tray icons.
  * Rework Blockcheck lifecycle around dedicated systemd worker and recovery units.
  * Replace the updater overlay with manifest-based staging, atomic directory exchange,
    persistent transaction journaling, and service-aware crash recovery.
  * Harden upstream archive validation, binary checksum verification, and preservation
    of user configuration, hostlists, custom scripts, and unknown legacy files.
  * Standardize application, executable, helper, desktop, Polkit, systemd, and package IDs.
  * Expand automated regression coverage and Debian/Fedora package smoke tests.

 -- avsprv <avsprv@users.noreply.github.com>  Tue, 10 Nov 2026 09:00:00 +0300

zapret2applet (0.4.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add safe configuration and profile management with validation and backups.
  * Add user hostlist editing and read-only access to generated IP lists.
  * Add a read-only systemd journal monitor for zapret2.service.
  * Expand helper validation and regression test coverage.

